{"lang":"ms","exact":{"Savile Row":"Savile Row","Unhurried fittings, trusted makers.":"Sesi ukur tenang, tukang dipercayai.","Personal introductions to London’s finest tailors, cutters and craftspeople — arranged quietly around your diary.":"Perkenalan peribadi dengan tukang jahit dan pengrajin terbaik London — diatur tenang mengikut jadual anda.","Bond Street":"Bond Street","Private viewing rooms, never the crowds.":"Bilik pameran peribadi, jauh daripada kesesakan.","Closed-door salon appointments, rare timepieces and personal shopping prepared before you step inside.":"Temu janji salun tertutup, jam tangan jarang ditemui dan beli-belah peribadi tersedia sebelum anda tiba.","Mayfair & St James’s":"Mayfair & St James’s","The right table, for the right company.":"Meja yang tepat, untuk teman yang tepat.","Sought-after dining rooms, tucked-away private vaults and members’ club introductions shaped around your evening.":"Ruang makan eksklusif, bilik simpanan peribadi dan perkenalan kelab ahli mengikut malam anda.","Global Travel":"Perjalanan Global","Every mile handled from one conversation.":"Setiap batu diatur daripada satu perbualan.","Private aviation, flagship suites, villas and waiting chauffeurs coordinated together so you travel without friction.":"Penerbangan peribadi, suite utama, vila dan pemandu menunggu diselaraskan untuk perjalanan lancar.","Homes & Escapes":"Kediaman & Percutian","London townhouses and quiet country weekends.":"Rumah bandar London dan hujung minggu desa yang tenang.","Your residences kept ready before you arrive, and unhurried countryside stays prepared down to the last detail.":"Kediaman anda tersedia sebelum ketibaan, dan penginapan desa disiapkan hingga perincian terakhir.","London after dark, quietly curated.":"London selepas senja, diatur dengan tenang.","Intimate music rooms, candlelit cellars and late tables — with your driver waiting outside whenever you are ready.":"Bilik muzik intim, ruang bawah tanah bercahaya lilin dan meja lewat malam — dengan pemandu anda menunggu di luar.","After Hours":"Selepas Waktu","Private river crossings, quiet dining vaults and late-night rooms across London.":"Pelayaran sungai peribadi, ruang makan tenang dan bilik lewat malam di seluruh London.","The London our members love most rarely appears on public lists. It lives behind unmarked Mayfair doors, inside candlelit City cellars and along quiet evening piers. Through trusted local hosts, we shape low-key nights that feel unmistakably yours.":"London yang paling digemari ahli kami jarang tersenarai secara umum. Ia tersembunyi di sebalik pintu Mayfair, bilik bawah tanah City dan jeti malam yang tenang. Bersama tuan rumah tempatan dipercayai, kami membentuk malam yang benar-benar milik anda.","All venues and introductions are subject to availability.":"Semua tempat dan perkenalan tertakluk kepada ketersediaan.","Candlelit wine vaults and private dining rooms tucked beneath Mayfair and the City":"Bilik bawah tanah bercahaya lilin dan ruang makan peribadi di bawah Mayfair dan City","Private evening Thames crossings paired with discreet riverside arrivals":"Pelayaran petang peribadi di Sungai Thames dengan ketibaan tepi sungai yang tenang","Late-night Soho jazz rooms, intimate listening bars and quiet tables away from the crowds":"Bilik jaz lewat malam di Soho, ruang dengar intim dan meja tenang jauh daripada kesesakan","Tell us what you are in the mood for — a long weekend away, an understated celebration or a Savile Row introduction — and our Mayfair desk will build tailored ideas around your dates.":"Beritahu kami apa yang anda inginkan — hujung minggu panjang, sambutan sederhana atau perkenalan Savile Row — dan pejabat Mayfair kami akan menyusun cadangan mengikut tarikh anda.","Direct Mayfair Desk":"Pejabat Langsung Mayfair","The Global Luxury Consortium":"The Global Luxury Consortium","Prefer a real conversation to filling in a form? Speak directly with our team on Albemarle Street — every enquiry is answered personally, in complete confidence.":"Lebih suka perbualan sebenar berbanding mengisi borang? Hubungi pasukan kami di Albemarle Street — setiap pertanyaan dijawab secara peribadi dan sulit.","From early morning private arrivals to late dinners in Mayfair, one trusted voice keeps every moving part calm and connected.":"Daripada ketibaan peribadi awal pagi hingga makan malam lewat di Mayfair, satu suara dipercayai menyelaraskan segalanya.","Seven connected practice areas under one dedicated Mayfair desk — so your flights, dining rooms, residences, chauffeurs and rare commissions all move in step.":"Tujuh bidang amalan saling berhubung di bawah satu pejabat Mayfair — agar penerbangan, restoran, kediaman, pemandu dan pesanan khas bergerak seiring.","We warmly cater to Islamic and Muslim traditions — from certified halal fine dining, Ramadan Iftar and Suhoor hospitality, alcohol-free suites and prayer-space preparation to private family residences and female chauffeurs on request.":"Kami menyantuni tradisi Islam dan Muslim dengan penuh hormat — daripada santapan halus halal bertauliah, jamuan Iftar dan Sahur Ramadan, suite bebas alkohol, ruang solat hingga kediaman keluarga peribadi dan pemandu wanita atas permintaan.","We respect every culture, faith and family custom equally — welcoming Jewish, Hindu, Jain, Sikh, East Asian and European households across twenty global languages.":"Kami menghormati setiap budaya, kepercayaan dan adat keluarga sama rata — mengalu-alukan keluarga Yahudi, Hindu, Jain, Sikh, Asia Timur dan Eropah dalam dua puluh bahasa.","Islamic & Halal":"Islam & Halal","Ramadan, Halal Dining & Family Privacy":"Ramadan, Makanan Halal & Privasi Keluarga","All Cultures":"Semua Budaya","Global Faiths & Family Customs":"Kepercayaan Global & Adat Keluarga","Islamic, Muslim & global traditions, quietly honoured.":"Tradisi Islam, Muslim dan global dihormati dengan tenang.","Thoughtful London stays shaped around Muslim life.":"Penginapan London yang teliti dibent